        "question": "下面 init_sieve 函数的时间复杂度为（　）。\nfor (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) sieve[i] = i;\nfor (int i = 2; i <= n; i++)\n    for (int j = i; j <= n; j += i)\n        sieve[j]--;",
        "options": {
            "A": "O(n)",
